---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
---

<Base title="Matthew Rossi">

  <div class="home-header">
    <div class="home-header-name">
      <h1>Matthew Rossi</h1>
      <span class="location">Brooklyn, New York</span>
    </div>
    <p class="tagline">Senior software engineer transitioning to sustainable urban mobility policy and planning.</p>
    <ContactLinks />
  </div>

  <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h2 id="about-heading">About</h2>
    <p>I grew up outside Detroit, a place built almost entirely around the car; where the near-total absence of alternatives made the relationship between transportation and daily life hard to take for granted. That early awareness turned into a lasting interest in how cities move people, and what it costs when they can't.</p>
    <p>I'm now pursuing that through graduate study at the EIT Urban Mobility Master School, starting autumn 2026.</p>
    <p>Thirteen years of software work — across fintech, financial services, and cloud infrastructure — gave me a systems-level view of how complex institutions hold together and where they fail.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="now" aria-labelledby="now-heading">
    <h2 id="now-heading">Now</h2>
    <p>Currently a Senior Software Engineer at <a href="https://www.heroku.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heroku (Salesforce)</a> in New York, building distributed credential and authorization infrastructure for next-generation cloud platforms.</p>
    <p>Starting autumn 2026, I'll be a full-time student in the <strong>EIT Urban Mobility Master's Program in Sustainable Urban Mobility Transitions (SUMT)</strong> — a two-year double degree program. The first year of study will be at University of Lisbon–Técnico IST in Lisbon, Portugal. The second year will be at Polytechnic University of Catalonia in Barcelona, Spain.</p>
  </section>

</Base>
